<title>GERMANY: AGIV says H1 sales, incoming orders rise.</title>
<headline>AGIV says H1 sales, incoming orders rise.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  3,856   vs 3,680</p>
<p>Of which:</p>
<p>     -- Machinery and electronics	  1,531   vs 1,317</p>
<p>     -- Energy technology		    487     vs 529</p>
<p>     -- Building industry		    1,643   vs 1,701</p>
<p>     -- Transport and logistics	    195     vs 133</p>
<p>    Group orders in hand		     8,388   vs 8,128</p>
<p>    Group incoming orders		    4,879   vs 4,645</p>
<p>    Group workforce			    34,260  vs 35,680</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German diversified industrial group is Aktiengesellschaft fuer Industrie und Verkehrswesen.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
